====Verb====
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To [[take part]] in a [[#Noun|race]] (in the sense of a contest).
#: {{ux|en|The drivers were '''racing''' around the track.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1875|editor=John Henry Walsh|chapter=Lichfield Open Meeting|title=Coursing Calendar for the Autumn Season 1874|pageurl=https://www.google.com/books/edition/The_Coursing_calendar_ed_by_Stonehenge/newNAAAAQAAJ?hl=en&gbpv=1&pg=PA187&printsec=frontcover|page=187|text=Honesty '''raced''' up six lengths in front of Wandering Minstrel, turned, then '''raced''' past for the second, and lost his place at the hedge; some work followed to the plantation, but Honesty was always the faster in the racing stretches, and won easily.}}
