A variant of {{m|en|raze}}.<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=''v.''{{sup|2}}|noformat=1|id=7122083669|date=December 2024}}</ref>

From {{inh|en|enm|rasen}}, {{m|enm|racen}}, {{m|enm|rase|t=to scrape; to shave; to erase; to rend; to cleave; etc}}, from {{der|en|xno|raser}}, {{m|xno|rasere}}, {{m|xno|rasser}}, {{der|en|frm|raser}}, and {{der|en|fro|raser|t=to shave; to demolish}}, from {{der|en|VL.|*raso|t=to shave; to scrape}}, from {{der|en|la|rāsus|t=scraped; shaved}}, the {{glossary|perfect}} {{glossary|passive}} {{glossary|participle}} of {{m|la|rādō|t=to scrape, scratch}}. {{doublet|en|rash}} ([[rash#Etymology 2|etymology 2]] and [[rash#Etymology 7|etymology 7]]).

